C ~20m concrete shield reproduction (MCNP cm = ~2000 coordinate units)
C synthetic control: large RPP + cavity + pipes, matching user-reported size
C Cell cards
C 1: concrete shield block (inside outer 2000-unit cube, minus cavity/pipes)
1    1  -2.30   1 -2 3 -4 5 -6  #2 #3 #4   imp:n=1
C 2: equipment room cavity (air, RPP)
2    0        -1007                        imp:n=1
C 3: vertical service shaft (air, C/Z pipe r=120)
3    0        -1008                        imp:n=1
C 4: horizontal cooling duct (air, RCC r=180)
4    0        -1009                        imp:n=1
C 5: outside world void
9000 0        -1:2:-3:4:-5:6               imp:n=0

C Surface cards
C outer boundary, 2000-unit cube (40m span)
1  px  -2000.0
2  px   2000.0
3  py  -2000.0
4  py   2000.0
5  pz  -2000.0
6  pz   2000.0
C equipment room RPP
1007  rpp  -800.0  800.0  -800.0  800.0  -600.0  1200.0
C vertical shaft: C/Z radius 120
1008  cz   120.0
C horizontal duct: RCC base(0,0,-2000) axis z length 4000 radius 180
1009  rcc  0.0 0.0 -2000.0  0.0 0.0 4000.0  180.0

C Data cards
mode n
imp:n 1 1 1 1 0
nps 1000
print
